<title>PHILIPPINES: Kepphil sets record date for stock div.</title>
<headline>Kepphil sets record date for stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Kepphil Shipyard Inc said on Monday it set January 10 as the record date for its eight percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend was declared last June 26 but the Securities and Exchange Commission had just approved the registration of the new shares recently, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
